# Dolibarr language file - en_US - dolimcp
DoliMcpName=DoliMCP
DoliMcpDescription=Remote MCP server for Dolibarr
DoliMcpDescriptionDetail=Exposes your Dolibarr as an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server over HTTP. Connect Claude, Claude Code or any MCP-compatible AI agent to your ERP: browse and manage third parties, invoices, products, orders, projects, documents… with the permissions of the user tied to the API key.
DoliMcpSetup=DoliMCP setup
DoliMcpSetupIntro=This module exposes an MCP endpoint (Streamable HTTP). Each client authenticates with a Dolibarr user's API key: actions are performed with that user's permissions, through the REST API.
DoliMcpEndpoint=MCP endpoint URL
DoliMcpTransport=Transport
DoliMcpServerPackage=MCP server package
DoliMcpServerPackageMissing=Not found — install the Dalfred module or bundle the dolibarr-mcp-server package
DoliMcpRestApiModule=REST API module (required)
DoliMcpClientExamples=Client configuration examples
DoliMcpGenericClient=Generic MCP client
DoliMcpAuthNote=Authentication: "Authorization: Bearer <API key>" header (recommended) or "DOLAPIKEY: <API key>" header.
DoliMcpApiKeyHelp=A user's API key is generated on their card: Users & Groups > user card > "API key" tab. The user must have the permissions matching the expected actions.
